<pre>
decision theory ≠ descriptive choice psychology
utility ≠ money / happiness by definition
game theory ≠ zero-sum theory
Nash equilibrium ≠ social optimum
mechanism design ≠ generic design
incentive ≠ reward only
coordination problem ≠ collective-action problem
